#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:1
msgid "Automatic session archiving after a PR merge"
msgstr "PR 合并后自动归档会话"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:3
msgid ""
"The main control-plane listener checks published GitHub PRs and archives "
"the sessions whose current completed work belongs to a merged PR. Checks "
"run every 30 seconds by default, using the existing GitHub integration. "
"No webhook URL, external scheduler, or separate session API is required."
msgstr ""
"主控制平面监听器会定期检查已发布的 GitHub PR：如果一个会话最近完成的工作所在的 PR 已经合并，就把这个会话归档。默认每 30 "
"秒检查一次，用的是现有的 GitHub 集成，不需要配置 webhook URL、外部调度器或单独的会话 API。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:8
msgid "Components and integration points"
msgstr "组件与对接点"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:20
msgid ""
"`storage/repositories/snapshot.py` records published PR links on "
"contributing jobs. Job IDs, session IDs and owner IDs provide the trusted"
" mapping."
msgstr ""
"`storage/repositories/snapshot.py` 把已发布的 PR 链接记到参与这次发布的任务上。任务 ID、会话 ID "
"和所有者 ID 构成可信的对应关系。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:22
msgid ""
"`storage/repositories/pr_archive.py` discovers eligible sessions, claims "
"checks, records retries, and commits archival with a completion receipt."
msgstr "`storage/repositories/pr_archive.py` 负责找出符合条件的会话、认领检查、记录重试，并在提交归档时写入完成回执。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:24
msgid ""
"`workers/pr_archive.py` validates PR links, verifies repository access, "
"fetches merge state, and retries failures."
msgstr "`workers/pr_archive.py` 负责校验 PR 链接、确认有仓库访问权限、获取合并状态，失败时重试。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:26
msgid ""
"`bootstrap/lifespan.py` starts and stops the worker in the main listener."
" The MCP-only listener does not run another copy."
msgstr "`bootstrap/lifespan.py` 在主监听器里启动和停止这个 worker。MCP 专用监听器不会再跑一份。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:28
msgid ""
"Migration `0040_pr_merge_archive` creates `agent_pr_archive_checks`, "
"including a due-work index and a unique receipt per `(thread_id, "
"pr_url)`."
msgstr ""
"迁移 `0040_pr_merge_archive` 新建了 `agent_pr_archive_checks` "
"表，包括一个用于查找待办检查的索引，并保证每个 `(thread_id, pr_url)` 只有一条回执。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:31
msgid ""
"Polling is both the detection mechanism and the reconciliation mechanism."
" Restarting the control plane does not lose associations, receipts or "
"retry dates. A worker crash leaves a lease that another worker can "
"recover after expiry; lease tokens fence late writes from the previous "
"worker."
msgstr ""
"轮询既负责发现合并，也负责状态调和。重启控制平面不会丢失对应关系、回执或下次重试的时间。worker 崩溃后会留下一个租约，租约过期后别的 "
"worker 可以接手；租约令牌能挡住上一个 worker 迟到的写入。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:36
msgid "Which sessions are archived"
msgstr "哪些会话会被归档"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:38
msgid ""
"The trigger is the session's **latest turn**, ordered by `turn_no`. It "
"must be successful and have a recorded published PR. The session must be "
"live and unarchived. Active or newer unpublished turns defer archival; "
"accepted pending owner messages also defer it."
msgstr ""
"判断依据是会话的**最新一轮**（按 `turn_no` 排序）：这一轮必须成功，并且记录了一个已发布的 "
"PR。会话本身必须仍然有效、尚未归档。如果还有进行中的轮次，或者有更新的、尚未发布的轮次，就先不归档；已经收下、还在排队的所有者消息也会让归档推迟。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:43
msgid ""
"A shared snapshot can publish one PR for multiple sessions. Each "
"qualifying contributor is processed independently. Other sessions in that"
" sandbox do not qualify merely because they share its workspace. Forks "
"copy publication links for display; copied history qualifies only if the "
"fork's own job actually belongs to a published snapshot. Original jobs "
"retain their existing direct publication association for compatibility."
msgstr ""
"一个共享快照可能为多个会话发布同一个 PR，每个符合条件的参与者都会单独处理。同一个沙箱里的其他会话，不会仅仅因为共用工作区就被归档。Fork "
"会复制发布链接用于展示；但只有 fork 自己的任务确实属于某个已发布的快照时，复制来的历史才算数。为了兼容，原来的任务保留现有的直接发布关联。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:50
msgid ""
"PR labels, titles, descriptions and branch names cannot select an archive"
" target. The worker extracts a number only from a persisted HTTPS GitHub "
"PR URL matching the stored repository. It constructs the API request from"
" the configured GitHub API origin and the stored repository, verifies "
"owner access, and checks the response's PR number, URL and base "
"repository. Only the boolean `merged: true`, with a valid merge "
"timestamp, authorizes archival. Closing a PR without merging leaves the "
"session active; slower checks permit a later reopen and merge to be "
"detected."
msgstr ""
"PR 的标签、标题、描述和分支名都无法指定归档对象。worker 只从已保存的、和记录中仓库一致的 HTTPS GitHub PR URL 里取出"
" PR 编号。它用配置好的 GitHub API 地址和记录中的仓库拼出 API 请求，确认所有者有访问权限，再核对响应里的 PR 编号、URL "
"和 base 仓库。只有布尔值 `merged: true` 加上有效的合并时间戳，才允许归档。PR "
"没合并就关闭的话，会话保持原样；之后还会以较低频率继续检查，这样 PR 被重新打开并合并时也能发现。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:59
msgid ""
"Immediately before committing, the repository locks the session and "
"rechecks ownership, the latest job, publication association and claim "
"token. A merge observed for an earlier turn cannot archive newly "
"submitted work."
msgstr ""
"提交之前的最后一刻，存储层会锁住这个会话，再核对一遍所有权、最新任务、发布关联和认领令牌。所以较早那一轮对应的 PR "
"合并了，也不会把之后新提交的工作一起归档。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:63
msgid "Archive actions"
msgstr "归档操作"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:65
msgid "The database transaction:"
msgstr "数据库事务会依次："

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:67
msgid ""
"Sets `agent_threads.archived_at`, preserving an existing archive "
"timestamp."
msgstr "设置 `agent_threads.archived_at`；如果已经有归档时间，就保留原值。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:68
msgid ""
"Pauses automatic goals, cancels queued goal rounds, and applies the "
"existing archived queue pause semantics."
msgstr "暂停自动目标、取消排队中的目标轮次，并按现有规则暂停已归档会话的消息队列。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:70
msgid ""
"Stores the merge timestamp, commit SHA, archive timestamp and completed "
"receipt in the ledger."
msgstr "把合并时间、commit SHA、归档时间和完成回执记到账本里。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:72
msgid ""
"Appends a `session_archived_pr_merged` lifecycle event to the associated "
"job."
msgstr "给关联的任务追加一个 `session_archived_pr_merged` 生命周期事件。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:74
msgid ""
"The existing owner-change notification updates the session list. "
"Transcripts, attachments, job history and PR links remain available in "
"the archive. Shared workspaces and retained native sessions remain "
"intact. Archival does not delete files or stop running agent processes."
msgstr ""
"现有的所有者变更通知会更新会话列表。归档后，对话记录、附件、任务历史和 PR "
"链接都还能看。共享工作区和保留的原生会话不受影响。归档不会删除文件，也不会停掉正在运行的 agent 进程。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:79
msgid ""
"Restoring a session preserves its completed receipt. The same PR merge "
"will not archive it again; a later distinct published PR can create a new"
" obligation."
msgstr "恢复一个会话时，它的完成回执会保留下来，所以同一次 PR 合并不会再把它归档一次；之后如果又发布了另一个 PR，才会产生新的归档要求。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:82
msgid "Configuration and rollout"
msgstr "配置与上线"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:84
msgid ""
"Back up the Agent database and apply `alembic upgrade head` through "
"`0040_pr_merge_archive` using the existing release migration workflow."
msgstr ""
"备份 Agent 数据库，然后按现有的发布迁移流程执行 `alembic upgrade head`，至少升级到 "
"`0040_pr_merge_archive`。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:86
msgid ""
"Deploy the updated main control plane and MCP listener. The worker starts"
" with the main listener and reads live saved settings and credentials."
msgstr "部署更新后的主控制平面和 MCP 监听器。worker 随主监听器启动，读取当前已保存的设置和凭据。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:88
msgid ""
"Configure the existing GitHub App installation and owner repository "
"access, or the existing deployment publication token and repository "
"allowlist. The App path requests repository-scoped `pull_requests: read` "
"tokens. Credentials remain in the control plane."
msgstr ""
"配置现有的 GitHub App 安装和所有者的仓库访问权限，或者使用现有的部署发布令牌和仓库白名单。走 GitHub App "
"时，申请的是限定在仓库范围内的 `pull_requests: read` 令牌。凭据始终只留在控制平面。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:92
msgid "In **Admin → Settings → Publication**, review these values:"
msgstr "在 **Admin → Settings → Publication** 里检查这些值："

