msgid "Block repeated non-transient access or invalid-response failures."
msgstr "同一个非临时性的访问错误或无效响应出现多少次后，停止检查。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:103
msgid ""
"`AGENT_PR_ARCHIVE_ENABLED` and `AGENT_PR_ARCHIVE_POLL_S` seed settings "
"only when the settings row is first created. For an existing deployment, "
"use the saved settings; changing environment values does not override "
"them. Enablement also applies to eligible sessions published before "
"deployment."
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_PR_ARCHIVE_ENABLED` 和 `AGENT_PR_ARCHIVE_POLL_S` "
"只在第一次创建设置记录时作为初始值。已有的部署以保存的设置为准，改环境变量不会覆盖它们。开启后，上线之前就已发布、符合条件的会话同样会被处理。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:108
msgid ""
"Set the control-plane log format to `json` for structured verification. "
"Validate with a test repository and session: merge its published PR, "
"confirm the session appears in archived history, inspect its lifecycle "
"event and ledger receipt, then restore it and confirm that the same merge"
" does not archive it again."
msgstr ""
"把控制平面的日志格式设为 `json`，方便用结构化日志核实。用一个测试仓库和测试会话验证：合并它发布的 "
"PR，确认会话出现在已归档的历史里，检查它的生命周期事件和账本回执；然后恢复这个会话，确认同一次合并不会再次把它归档。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:113
msgid "Failure handling and recovery"
msgstr "出错处理与恢复"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:115
msgid ""
"Open PRs are checked again on the ordinary interval. Closed, unmerged PRs"
" are checked on a slower interval of at least five minutes. Requests "
"sharing the same owner, repository and PR can share one verified result "
"during a pass."
msgstr ""
"未关闭的 PR 按常规间隔继续检查。已关闭但未合并的 PR 检查得慢一些，间隔至少五分钟。同一轮检查里，所有者、仓库和 PR "
"都相同的请求，可以共用一次核实结果。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:119
msgid ""
"Timeouts, transport failures, GitHub outages and rate limits retry "
"automatically with capped exponential backoff and jitter. Provider "
"retry/reset times take precedence over the configured cap. Missing "
"integration configuration does not consume a completed receipt; checks "
"can resume after configuration is repaired."
msgstr ""
"超时、网络故障、GitHub "
"宕机和触发速率限制，都会自动重试，采用带上限和随机抖动的指数退避。服务商给出的重试或重置时间优先于配置的上限。缺少集成配置不会把回执标记为完成；配置修好后，检查会继续进行。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:124
msgid ""
"Invalid mappings or mismatched API identities block the affected "
"association. Repeated access or invalid-response errors also become "
"terminal skipped rows after the configured threshold. Logs record safe "
"reason codes, without provider response bodies, credentials or session "
"content. Failure of one check does not discard other sessions' "
"obligations."
msgstr ""
"对应关系无效，或 API 返回的身份对不上，受影响的那条对应关系就会被拦下。访问错误或无效响应反复出现，达到配置的次数后，这条记录也会变成终态的 "
"skipped。日志只记录安全的原因代码，不记录服务商的响应内容、凭据或会话内容。一条检查失败，不会影响其他会话的归档。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:130
msgid "Inspect ledger state with read-only SQL:"
msgstr "用只读 SQL 查看账本状态："

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:139
msgid ""
"After fixing the recorded mapping or access problem, an operator can "
"retry one terminal skipped association using bound parameters:"
msgstr "把记录里的对应关系或访问权限问题修好之后，运维人员可以用绑定参数，单独重试一条终态为 skipped 的记录："

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:150
msgid ""
"Completed archive receipts must remain intact when restoring a session. "
"Do not clear a live claim token; its lease provides crash recovery."
msgstr "恢复会话时，已完成的归档回执必须原样保留。不要清除仍然有效的认领令牌，崩溃恢复要靠它的租约。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:153
msgid ""
"Successful archival emits `agent_session_archived_after_pr_merge`; retry "
"and blocked events use `agent_pr_archive_check_failed` and "
"`agent_pr_archive_blocked`. These records and durable lifecycle events "
"provide verification without an external notification destination. "
"Configure existing log alerting for blocked checks and persistent worker "
"failures."
msgstr ""
"归档成功时会记录 `agent_session_archived_after_pr_merge`；重试和被拦下时分别记录 "
"`agent_pr_archive_check_failed` 和 "
"`agent_pr_archive_blocked`。即使没有配置外部通知，靠这些日志和持久化的生命周期事件也能核实结果。请为被拦下的检查和持续失败的"
" worker 配置现有的日志告警。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:159
msgid "Timing and acceptance"
msgstr "时效与验收"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:161
#, python-format
msgid ""
"For eligible sessions under ordinary load and healthy dependencies, "
"target merge-to-archive latency of at most 60 seconds for 95% of merges. "
"Measure from the provider's merge timestamp to the stored archive "
"timestamp. This is an operating target, not a measured production result."
" Active turns, pending messages, backlog, rate budgets and retry delays "
"can extend it. Reopened PRs may wait for their slower closed-PR check. "
"After an outage, durable checks resume automatically; a crashed claim "
"becomes eligible after lease expiry."
msgstr ""
"在负载正常、依赖服务健康的情况下，目标是：符合条件的会话中，95% 能在合并后 60 "
"秒内完成归档。计时从服务商记录的合并时间算起，到存储的归档时间为止。这是运维目标，不是生产环境的实测数据。进行中的轮次、排队的消息、积压、速率配额和重试延迟都可能让它变长。重新打开的"
" PR 可能要等到下一次较慢的已关闭 PR 检查。故障恢复后，持久化的检查会自动继续；崩溃时留下的认领，等租约过期后就能重新处理。"

#: ../developer/automatic-pr-archiving.md:169
msgid ""
"Verify duplicate processing, worker races and restart recovery; shared PR"
" contributors; unrelated and inherited fork sessions; new work submitted "
"during a merge check; closed and reopened PRs; mismatched API identities;"
" credential rotation; rate limits; and restoration after archival. No "
"test should produce an incorrect session archive. Run `make check` and "
"the database-backed archive tests before release."
msgstr ""
"需要验证的场景包括：重复处理、worker 之间的竞争和重启恢复；多个会话共享同一个 PR；无关的 fork 会话和继承了历史的 fork "
"会话；合并检查期间提交的新工作；关闭后又重新打开的 PR；API "
"返回的身份对不上；凭据轮换；速率限制；以及归档后的恢复。任何一个测试都不应该出现错误归档。发布前要跑 `make check` "
"和依赖数据库的归档测试。"

